{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "governance-vscode-copilot",
  "title": "VS Code Copilot",
  "description": "Editor sessions, tools, code edits and acceptance from VS Code Copilot Chat. GitHub daily reports and seat assignments live in the separate Copilot reports dashboard.",
  "tags": [
    "governance"
  ],
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Export PNG",
      "icon": "external link",
      "url": "/render/d/governance-vscode-copilot?width=1280&height=-1&scale=1&fullPageImage=true&kiosk=true&hideNav=true&timeout=180",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "tooltip": "Full dashboard image; allow up to 3 minutes. Uses the selected time range and filters."
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Governance overview",
      "url": "/d/governance-ai-cli-telemetry",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Code changes",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lines added / removed, by language",
      "description": "sum by (copilot_chat_language_id, type) (increase(copilot_chat_lines_of_code_count_total[$__interval])). Confirmed live in Mimir with real, non-empty history over the last 7 days -- languages seen: just, rust, yaml, shellscript. Not filtered by `job`: both copilot-chat (pre-#272 file exporter) and ai-cli/copilot-chat (post-#272 daemon) already report the same metric, and comparing the two paths' adoption is a separate question this panel does not answer.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (copilot_chat_language_id, type) (increase(copilot_chat_lines_of_code_count_total[$__interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{copilot_chat_language_id}} ({{type}})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Net lines (7d)",
      "description": "sum(increase(...{type=\"added\"}[7d])) - sum(increase(...{type=\"removed\"}[7d])). A single top-line answer to 'is the agent writing code, on net' -- the same question 'lines of code the agents are writing' asks, reduced to one number.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_lines_of_code_count_total{type=\"added\"}[7d])) - sum(increase(copilot_chat_lines_of_code_count_total{type=\"removed\"}[7d]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Lines added by language (7d)",
      "description": "topk(10, sum by (copilot_chat_language_id) (increase(...{type=\"added\"}[7d]))), as an instant snapshot table.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (copilot_chat_language_id) (increase(copilot_chat_lines_of_code_count_total{type=\"added\"}[7d])))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sessions (7d)",
      "description": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_session_count_total[7d])).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_session_count_total[7d]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tool calls (7d)",
      "description": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_tool_call_count_total[7d])).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_tool_call_count_total[7d]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Edit acceptance rate (7d)",
      "description": "accepted / (accepted + rejected), from copilot_chat_chat_edit_outcome_count_total{copilot_chat_edit_outcome=...}. A dropping rate is the signal worth a human's attention -- the same edit outcomes reported by VS Code Copilot.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null+nan",
                "result": {
                  "text": "NO DATA",
                  "color": "gray",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(copilot_chat_chat_edit_outcome_count_total{copilot_chat_edit_outcome=\"accepted\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(copilot_chat_chat_edit_outcome_count_total[7d]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
